# 🕌 Prayer Times Calculator

A **pure Python + Streamlit** prayer times application based on
**Shafi Madhhab** and **Umm al-Qura** methodology.

## ✨ Features
- Accurate prayer time computation (no external prayer libraries)
- Shafi Asr (shadow = 1× object length)
- Umm al-Qura Isha (90 min after Maghrib)
- Auto-location via IP
- Hijri date support
- Qibla direction calculation
- Full-year CSV export
- Streamlit UI
- Global-ready architecture

## 📁 Project Structure

prayer_app/
├── app.py
├── main.py
├── core/
│ ├── prayer_engine.py
│ ├── astro_utils.py
│ ├── solar_angles.py
│ ├── cities.py
│ ├── hijri.py
│ ├── qibla.py
│ ├── location.py
│ ├── csv_generator.py
│ └── rounding.py

## ▶️ Run Locally
```bash
pip install streamlit requests hijri-converter
streamlit run app.py
